 426:CANopen/301/CO_driver.h **** /**
 427:CANopen/301/CO_driver.h ****  * @defgroup CO_CAN_ERR_status_t CAN error status bitmasks
 428:CANopen/301/CO_driver.h ****  * @{
 429:CANopen/301/CO_driver.h ****  *
 430:CANopen/301/CO_driver.h ****  * CAN warning level is reached, if CAN transmit or receive error counter is more or equal to 96. C
 431:CANopen/301/CO_driver.h ****  * reached, if counters are more or equal to 128. Transmitter goes in error state 'bus off' if tran
 432:CANopen/301/CO_driver.h ****  * more or equal to 256.
